# x = 4 lives in the test's A-field. The if around one instruction is the inverted skip: SNE #4, #4
# does not skip, NOP runs, then ADD.A #1 writes x's place (the SNE itself) and the epilogue DAT ends
# the warrior.
golden: bbctests/examples/store_in_condition.bbc
alive 3
cell 3 0 SNE.AB #5, #4
dead 4
